### Controle Ja API - Gas Stations and Ranking Contract
### Base path: /controle_ja_api/v1/gas-stations
### Purpose: gerenciar postos de combustivel do usuario e consultar ranking por eficiencia/custo dos abastecimentos.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/controle_ja_api/v1
@token = replace-with-jwt
@gasStationId = replace-with-gas-station-id

### Controller summary
### GasStationController expoe criacao, listagem, consulta, edicao, exclusao logica e ranking de postos.
### Todas as rotas exigem Authorization Bearer token.
### O ranking e atualizado pelo fluxo de transactions quando um lancamento de abastecimento possui dados confiaveis.

### Existing controller decisions
### - GET/PUT/DELETE por id validam que o posto pertence ao usuario autenticado.
### - DELETE faz soft delete; postos excluidos deixam de aparecer nas consultas comuns.
### - Ranking lista somente postos pertencentes ao usuario autenticado.
### - Ranking ignora abastecimentos sem posto, combustivel, litros, valor ou KM/L confiavel.
### - O primeiro abastecimento normalmente nao entra no ranking porque ainda nao existe registro anterior para calcular KM/L fiel.
### - A comparacao do ranking normaliza consumo cidade/estrada para reduzir distorcao entre perfis de uso.
### - Score vai de 0 a 10 e favorece menor custo ajustado por km.

### Common error contract
### 400 Bad Request
### {
###   "title": "Erro | Acesso negado | Erro de Validação",
###   "message": "Mensagem de regra ou validação"
### }
###
### 401 Unauthorized
### Token ausente, invalido ou expirado.

### Gas station request contract
### {
###   "name": "string obrigatorio",
###   "address": "string opcional",
###   "city": "string opcional",
###   "state": "string opcional"
### }

### Gas station response contract
### {
###   "id": "uuid",
###   "name": "string",
###   "address": "string|null",
###   "city": "string|null",
###   "state": "string|null"
### }

### Ranking response contract
### {
###   "id": "uuid",
###   "gasStationName": "string|null",
###   "fuelType": "GASOLINA | ETANOL | DIESEL | GNV | ELETRICO | OUTRO",
###   "totalLiters": "decimal",
###   "refuelCount": "integer",
###   "cityRefuelCount": "integer",
###   "roadRefuelCount": "integer",
###   "unknownRefuelCount": "integer",
###   "avgKml": "decimal",
###   "adjustedAvgKml": "decimal",
###   "avgCostPerKm": "decimal",
###   "lastPricePerLiter": "decimal",
###   "score": "decimal entre 0 e 10"
### }

### Create gas station
POST {{baseUrl}}/gas-stations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Posto Central",
  "address": "Rua Teste, 123",
  "city": "Sao Paulo",
  "state": "SP"
}

### Expected 200 response
### Gas station response contract.

### List my gas stations
GET {{baseUrl}}/gas-stations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### [
###   Gas station response contract
### ]

### Get my gas station by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/gas-stations/{{gasStationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### Gas station response contract.
###
### Expected 400 when station belongs to another user
### {
###   "title": "Acesso negado",
###   "message": "Este posto não pertence a você."
### }

### Update my gas station
PUT {{baseUrl}}/gas-stations/{{gasStationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Posto Central Atualizado",
  "address": "Avenida Teste, 456",
  "city": "Sao Paulo",
  "state": "SP"
}

### Expected 200 response
### Gas station response contract.

### Delete my gas station
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/gas-stations/{{gasStationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### {
###   "message": "Registro excluído com sucesso."
### }

### List my ranking
GET {{baseUrl}}/gas-stations/ranking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected 200 response
### [
###   Ranking response contract
### ]
